---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Integrações & Chaves de API | Nicopel Cargo">
  <div class="page-integracoes">
    <div class="header-section">
      <div class="title-group">
        <h1><i class="fas fa-key"></i> Integrações & Chaves de API</h1>
        <p>Gere e gerencie chaves de API com validade para integrar a Nicopel Cargo com sistemas externos e planilhas do Excel.</p>
      </div>
      <button id="btn-new-key" class="btn-primary">
        <i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Gerar Nova Chave
      </button>
    </div>

    <!-- Container do Token Gerado (Exibido uma única vez por segurança) -->
    <div id="new-key-success-card" class="glass-card new-key-success" style="display: none;">
      <div class="success-header">
        <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i>
        <h3>Chave de API Gerada com Sucesso!</h3>
      </div>
      <p class="warning-text"><i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle"></i> Por motivos de segurança, copie a chave agora. Você não poderá visualizá-la novamente.</p>
      <div class="key-display-box">
        <code id="raw-key-value">np_live_...</code>
        <button id="btn-copy-raw-key" class="btn-icon" title="Copiar Chave"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i></button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-layout">
      <!-- Painel Esquerdo: Minhas Chaves -->
      <div class="glass-card animate-fade-in">
        <h2 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-list"></i> Chaves de API Ativas</h2>
        <div class="table-wrapper">
          <table class="data-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Nome</th>
                <th>Usuário</th>
                <th>Permissão</th>
                <th>Expira em</th>
                <th>Criada em</th>
                <th class="text-right">Ações</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="keys-table-body">
              <tr>
                <td colspan="6" class="loading-td">
                  <i class="fas fa-circle-notch fa-spin"></i> Carregando chaves...
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Painel Direito: Guias Práticos -->
      <div class="glass-card instructions-card">
        <h2 class="card-title"><i class="fas fa-book"></i> Guias de Integração</h2>
        
        <div class="tabs">
          <button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="tab-excel"><i class="fas fa-file-excel"></i> Microsoft Excel</button>
          <button class="tab-btn" data-tab="tab-graphql"><i class="fas fa-code"></i> GraphQL API</button>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content active" id="tab-excel">
          <h3>Como usar os dados no Excel / Power Query:</h3>
          <ol class="steps-list">
            <li>Gere uma chave de API do tipo <strong>Apenas Leitura (READ_ONLY)</strong> no botão acima.</li>
            <li>No Excel, vá na aba <strong>Dados</strong> > <strong>Obter Dados</strong> > <strong>De Outras Fontes</strong> > <strong>Da Web</strong>.</li>
            <li>Selecione a opção <strong>Básico</strong> e cole a URL de exportação abaixo:
              <div class="code-copy-box">
                <code id="excel-url-display">https://cotacao.nicopel.com.br/api/integration/excel/quotations?apiKey=SUA_CHAVE_AQUI</code>
                <button id="btn-copy-excel-url" class="btn-icon"><i class="fas fa-copy"></i></button>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>Clique em <strong>OK</strong>. O Excel importará os dados formatados em colunas automaticamente.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="tab-content" id="tab-graphql">
          <h3>Como interagir com a GraphQL API:</h3>
          <p>Você pode testar e consumir a API executando requisições POST para <code>/graphql</code> enviando o header <code>X-API-Key</code>.</p>
          <pre class="code-block"><code>{`query {
  externalQuotations(limit: 10) {
    id
    status
    valor_total_produtos
    client {
      razao_social
      cnpj
    }
  }
}`}</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Modal de Nova Chave -->
  <div id="key-modal" class="modal">
    <div class="modal-content glass-premium">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h2>Gerar Chave de API</h2>
        <button class="close-modal">&times;</button>
      </div>
      <form id="key-form">
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="key-name">Nome Identificador</label>
          <input type="text" id="key-name" required placeholder="Ex: Planilha de Faturamento Excel" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-grid-inner">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="key-validity">Validade da Chave</label>
            <select id="key-validity" required>
              <option value="30">30 dias</option>
              <option value="90">90 dias</option>
              <option value="365">365 dias (1 ano)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group" id="role-group" style="display: none;">
            <label for="key-role">Nível de Permissão</label>
            <select id="key-role">
              <option value="READ_ONLY">Apenas Leitura (READ_ONLY)</option>
              <option value="FULL_ACCESS">Acesso Total (FULL_ACCESS)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-footer">
          <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Confirmar e Gerar</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>

<script is:inline>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const tableBody = document.getElementById('keys-table-body');
    const modal = document.getElementById('key-modal');
    const btnNewKey = document.getElementById('btn-new-key');
    const closeModal = document.querySelector('.close-modal');
    const keyForm = document.getElementById('key-form');
    const successCard = document.getElementById('new-key-success-card');
    const rawKeyValue = document.getElementById('raw-key-value');
    const btnCopyRawKey = document.getElementById('btn-copy-raw-key');
    const roleGroup = document.getElementById('role-group');
    const excelUrlDisplay = document.getElementById('excel-url-display');
    const btnCopyExcelUrl = document.getElementById('btn-copy-excel-url');

    const user = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('user_info') || '{}');

    // Mostra opção de nível apenas para Admins
    if (user.role === 'ADMIN') {
      roleGroup.style.display = 'block';
    }

    // Configura a URL base de exemplo do Excel
    const apiBase = window.PUBLIC_API_URL || window.location.origin;
    const excelExportUrl = `${apiBase}/api/integration/excel/quotations?apiKey=SUA_CHAVE_AQUI`;
    excelUrlDisplay.textContent = excelExportUrl;

    // Busca e renderiza as chaves
    async function loadKeys() {
      try {
        const res = await window.safeFetch('/api/api-keys');
        if (!res.ok) throw new Error();
        const keys = res.data || [];
        
        if (keys.length === 0) {
          tableBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center">Nenhuma chave de API gerada.</td></tr>`;
          return;
        }

        tableBody.innerHTML = keys.map(k => `
          <tr>
            <td><strong>${k.name}</strong></td>
            <td>${k.user?.username || 'Você'}</td>
            <td><span class="badge ${k.role === 'FULL_ACCESS' ? 'badge-danger' : 'badge-info'}">${k.role}</span></td>
            <td>${new Date(k.expiresAt).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR')}</td>
            <td>${new Date(k.createdAt).toLocaleDateString('pt-BR')}</td>
            <td class="text-right">
              <button class="btn-danger btn-sm btn-delete-key" data-id="${k.id}">
                <i class="fas fa-trash"></i>
              </button>
            </td>
          </tr>
        `).join('');

        // Vincula botões de delete
        document.querySelectorAll('.btn-delete-key').forEach(btn => {
          btn.onclick = async () => {
            if (confirm('Tem certeza que deseja revogar esta chave de API? Ela parará de funcionar imediatamente.')) {
              await window.safeFetch(`/api/api-keys/${btn.dataset.id}`, { method: 'DELETE' });
              window.showToast('Chave de API revogada com sucesso.', 'info');
              loadKeys();
            }
          };
        });
      } catch (err) {
        tableBody.innerHTML = `<tr><td colspan="6" class="text-center text-danger">Erro ao carregar chaves de API.</td></tr>`;
      }
    }

    loadKeys();

    // Modal
    btnNewKey.onclick = () => modal.classList.add('show');
    closeModal.onclick = () => modal.classList.remove('show');
    window.onclick = (e) => { if (e.target === modal) modal.classList.remove('show'); };

    // Formulário de Criação
    keyForm.onsubmit = async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('key-name').value;
      const expiresDays = +document.getElementById('key-validity').value;
      const role = document.getElementById('key-role')?.value || 'READ_ONLY';

      try {
        const res = await window.safeFetch('/api/api-keys', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ name, expiresDays, role })
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          window.showToast('Chave de API criada com sucesso!', 'success');
          modal.classList.remove('show');
          
          // Exibe o card do token gerado temporariamente
          successCard.style.display = 'block';
          rawKeyValue.textContent = res.data.rawKey;
          
          // Atualiza a URL do Excel de exemplo com a chave criada
          excelUrlDisplay.textContent = `${apiBase}/api/integration/excel/quotations?apiKey=${res.data.rawKey}`;

          btnCopyRawKey.onclick = () => {
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(res.data.rawKey);
            window.showToast('Chave copiada para a área de transferência!', 'success');
          };

          keyForm.reset();
          loadKeys();
        } else {
          window.showToast('Erro ao gerar chave de API.', 'error');
        }
      } catch (err) {
        window.showToast('Erro de conexão.', 'error');
      }
    };

    // Copiar URL do Excel
    btnCopyExcelUrl.onclick = () => {
      navigator.clipboard.writeText(excelUrlDisplay.textContent);
      window.showToast('URL de exportação copiada!', 'success');
    };

    // Tabs
    document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => {
      btn.onclick = () => {
        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        document.querySelectorAll('.tab-content').forEach(c => c.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        document.getElementById(btn.dataset.tab).classList.add('active');
      };
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
  .page-integracoes {
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }
  .header-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .title-group h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .grid-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  @media (max-width: 992px) {
    .grid-layout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .new-key-success {
    background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.1) !important;
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.3) !important;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .success-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: #10b981;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .warning-text {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #f59e0b;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .key-display-box {
    display: flex;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .key-display-box code {
    color: #38bdf8;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .badge {
    padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .badge-info {
    background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
    color: #38bdf8;
  }
  .badge-danger {
    background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.2);
    color: #ef4444;
  }
  .tabs {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .tab-btn {
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: #94a3b8;
    padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .tab-btn.active {
    color: #3b82f6;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #3b82f6;
  }
  .tab-content {
    display: none;
  }
  .tab-content.active {
    display: block;
  }
  .steps-list {
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .code-copy-box {
    display: flex;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .code-copy-box code {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .code-block {
    background: #090d16;
    padding: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
</style>
